      "content": "that's a good start. a bit generic though. can we make it punchier? like, maybe mention how the \"experts\" and the big media outlets are always telling people how to think, even though they don't actually understand what it's like to live in the real world or deal with the actual problems people are facing right now? give it that feeling that the people in charge are just out of touch.",
